{"id": "51", "pred": "Benefits of a Water Pik include helping to maintain good oral health by massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis, and cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas area that brushing can not access.", "raw_output": "Benefits of a Water Pik include helping to maintain good oral health by massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis, and cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas area that brushing can not access.", "gt": "A water pick has several benefits, according to the given passages. It can help eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, a water pick can clean better around the teeth and gums, reaching areas that brushing may not be able to access.", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 10.332, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 51, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [84323, 315, 264, 9959, 61162, 2924, 10476, 311, 10306, 1661, 20655, 2820, 553, 3072, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 17719, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 11, 323, 15826, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 3082, 429, 76726, 646, 537, 2615, 13], "logp_list": [-0.957, -0.0222, -0.0504, -0.6937, -0.0923, -0.1737, -1.2009, -0.0543, -0.1234, -0.0105, -0.0006, -0.0071, -0.9985, -0.0459, -0.0001, -0.0013, -0.0021, -0.0145, -0.0077, -0.0879, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.1508, -0.3905, -0.0005, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0561, -0.0151, -0.0016, -0.0102, -0.0629, -0.0546, -0.5864, -0.0069, -0.0183, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0001, -0.3838, -0.0056, -0.7797, -0.0236, -0.4799, -0.3745, -0.0033, -0.0545, -0.1567, -0.0039, -0.0033, 