{"id": "55", "pred": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keep the birds from reaching those spaces they often", "raw_output": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keep the birds from reaching those spaces they often", "gt": "You can prevent birds from building nests on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch and the top of the porch if it has open rafters. This will block the birds from reaching spaces they often choose to build their nests. If you have a light fixture, you can also install bird netting over it, but make sure the netting is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs and doesn't entangle birds. Another method is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, as this can scare birds away. Remember to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to it.", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 10.946, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 55, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [30485, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 2506, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545], "logp_list": [-0.3129, -0.29, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0616, -0.0084, -0.0129, -0.0011, -0.0539, -0.0083, -0.0041, -0.0039, -0.0122, -0.0001, -0.0939, -0.0006, -0.0012, -0.002, -0.2395, 