{"id": "60", "pred": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keep the birds from reaching those spaces they often", "raw_output": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keep the birds from reaching those spaces they often", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some ways to keep birds from building a nest on your porch:\n\n1. Attach bird netting to the eaves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun.\n2. Install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it.\n3. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question of how to keep birds from building a nest on your porch is:\n\nAttach bird netting to the eaves or install bird netting over the light fixture, and/or mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch.", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 10.895, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 55, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [30485, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 2506, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545], "logp_list": [-0.3129, -0.29, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0616, -0.0084, -0.0129, -0.0011, -0.0539, -0.0083, -0.0041, -0.0039, -0.0122, -0.0001, -0.0939, -0.0006, -0.0012, -0.002, -0.2395, -0.8537, -0.0052, -0.0006, -0.0546, -0.0146, 