{"id": "79", "pred": "Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat. When hot, lightly oil grate. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer; add the red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper. Pr", "raw_output": "Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat. When hot, lightly oil grate. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer; add the red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper. Pr", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's a brief guide on how to cook brats:\n\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grate.\n3. Combine beer, onions, red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper in a large pot. Bring to a boil.\n4. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture.\n5. Reduce heat to medium and cook for 10 to 12 minutes.\n6. Remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and place them on the preheated grill.\n7. Cook the bratwurst for 5 to 10 minutes, turning once.\n8. Serve the bratwurst with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\n\nSo, to cook brats, you first prepare the grill, then cook the bratwurst in a beer mixture before grilling them until they're done.", "question": "how to cook brats", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 11.606, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 58, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [4703, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 11051, 27561, 8628, 13, 3197, 4017, 11, 33404, 5590, 85354, 13, 46812, 279, 12883, 323, 44597, 304, 264, 3460, 3338, 26, 4446, 311, 264, 43690, 13, 3719, 19052, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 279, 12883, 26, 912, 279, 2518, 24353, 81623, 11, 30635, 16723, 11, 12021, 11, 323, 24353, 13, 2340], "logp_list": [-1.645, -0.0047, -0.4337, -0.003, -0.0005, -0.01, -0.002, -0.0022, -0.0004, -0.1014, -0.7771, -0.0237, -0.0026, -0.0006, -0.0008, -0.3586, -0.0145, -0.2088, -0.0037, -0.0016, -0.0036, -0.0005, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0007, -0.0029, -0.0105, -0.0029, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0024, -0.1036, -0.0002, -0.0007, -0.0026, -0.1035, -0.0123, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0567, -0.0017, -0.0013, -0.0012, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0015, -0.0, -0.0007, -0.0007, -0.0002, -0.001, -0.0084, -0.3587], "cumulative_logprob": -4.276, "norm_logp": -0.0737, "input_len": 524, "output_tokens": 58, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 42.74, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "85", "pred": "Place clean glass slide on a flat surface. Add one small drop of blood to one end. Take another clean slide, and go at an angle of about 45 deg, touch the blood with one end of the slide so the blood runs along the edge of the slide by capillary action. Push carefully along the length of the first slide to produce a thin smear of blood. Make 2 smears, allow to air dry, and label clearly. Once", "raw_output": "Place clean glass slide on a flat surface. Add one small drop of blood to one end. Take another clean slide, and go at an angle of about 45 deg, touch the blood with one end of the slide so the blood runs along the edge of the slide by capillary action. Push carefully along the length of the first slide to produce a thin smear of blood. Make 2 smears, allow to air dry, and label clearly. Once", "gt": "To prepare a blood slide, first sterilize a needle with a flame. Place a clean glass slide on a flat surface and add a small drop of blood to one end. Then, take another clean slide and holding it at an angle of about 45 degrees, touch the blood with one end of the slide so that the blood runs along the edge of the slide by capillary action. Push carefully along the length of the first slide to produce a thin smear of blood. Make two smears, allow them to air dry and label clearly. Once dried, place them in the provided slide transport containers. Always avoid coming into contact with another person's blood and if it is unavoidable, wear rubber gloves.", "question": "how to prepare blood slide", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 18.325, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 93, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [17371, 4240, 8991, 14983, 389, 264, 10063, 7329, 13, 2691, 825, 2613, 5943, 315, 6543, 311, 825, 835, 13, 11778, 2441, 4240, 14983, 11, 323, 728, 518, 458, 9210, 315, 911, 220, 19, 20, 5254, 11, 5796, 279, 