{"id": "627", "pred": "Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard him near the three-point line. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities", "raw_output": "Answer: Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard him near the three-point line. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities", "gt": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay close to them when they are near the three-point line, actively sliding your feet to minimize shot opportunities (passage 1). It is important to create a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player (passage 3).", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 8.092, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 41, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [16141, 25, 28737, 438, 3265, 438, 3204, 311, 264, 16217, 11, 25530, 31571, 979, 498, 7616, 1435, 3143, 279, 2326, 16574, 1555, 13, 3218, 3132, 14983, 697, 7541, 504, 3108, 311, 3108, 311, 4717, 3143, 697, 14704, 323, 29337, 6552, 10488], "logp_list": [-0.8378, -0.0086, -0.3835, -0.1138, -0.0004, -0.0024, -0.0002, -0.0041, -0.0157, -0.001, -0.0196, -0.0001, -0.0012, -0.2426, -0.0033, -0.0024, -0.0052, -0.0015, -0.0004, -0.0015, -0.0043, -0.0001, -0.0369, -0.0162, -0.0001, -0.0009, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.001, -0.0003, -0.0002, -0.0006, -0.0058, -0.0036, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0051, -0.0004, -0.001, -0.0005], "cumulative_logprob": -1.7232, "norm_logp": -0.042, "input_len": 247, "output_tokens": 41, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 47.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "631", "pred": "Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard him near the three-point line. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities", "raw_output": "Answer: Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard him near the three-point line. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's a brief answer to the question \"How to guard a tall person in basketball\":\n\nTo guard a tall person in basketball, it's important to stay as close as possible to them when they're near the three-point line. Slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities. Additionally, keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against them effectively.", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 8.431, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 41, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [16141, 25, 28737, 438, 3265, 438, 3204, 311, 264, 16217, 11, 25530, 31571, 979, 498, 7616, 1435, 3143, 279, 2326, 16574, 1555, 13, 3218, 3132, 14983, 697, 7541, 504, 3108, 311, 3108, 311, 4717, 3143, 697, 14704, 323, 29337, 6552, 10488], "logp_list": [-0.8378, -0.0086, -0.3835, -0.1138, -0.0004, -0.0024, -0.0002, -0.0041, -0.0157, -0.001, -0.0196, -0.0001, -0.0012, -0.2426, -0.0033, -0.0024, -0.0052, -0.0015, -0.0004, -0.0015, -0.0043, -0.0001, -0.0369, -0.0162, -0.0001, -0.0009, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.001, -0.0003, -0.0002, -0.0006, -0.0058, -0.0036, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0051, -0.0004, -0.001, -0.0005], "cumulative_logprob": -1.7232, "norm_logp": -0.042, "input_len": 247, "output_tokens": 41, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 56.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Statu