{"id": "635", "pred": "Both the nervous system and endocrine system are devoted to maintaining homeostasis by coordinating and regulating the activities of of cells, tissues, organs, and systems. Both systems are regulated by negative feedback mechanisms. Chemical messengers are important in both systems, although their method of transmission and release differs in the two systems.", "raw_output": "Both the nervous system and endocrine system are devoted to maintaining homeostasis by coordinating and regulating the activities of of cells, tissues, organs, and systems. Both systems are regulated by negative feedback mechanisms. Chemical messengers are important in both systems, although their method of transmission and release differs in the two systems.", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are the key similarities and differences between the nervous system and the endocrine system:\n\nSimilarities:\n\n* Both systems are involved in maintaining homeostasis by coordinating and regulating the activities of other cells, tissues, organs, and systems.\n* Both systems use chemical messengers (neurotransmitters and hormones) to transmit signals.\n* Both systems have negative feedback mechanisms to regulate their function.\n\nDifferences:\n\n* The nervous system is made up of neuron cells, while the endocrine system is composed of glands.\n* Transmission of signals occurs through electrical impulses in the nervous system, while hormones are responsible for signal transmission in the endocrine system.\n* The nervous system has a continuous structure, with cells connected to each other, while the endocrine system consists of discrete organs not physically connected to each other.\n* The nervous system uses neurons to transmit signals, while the endocrine system relies on the circulatory system to transmit signals.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "question": "similarity and difference between nervous system and endocrine system", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 12.866, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 63, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [20629, 279, 22596, 1849, 323, 835, 77638, 1849, 525, 28229, 311, 20337, 2114, 535, 10718, 553, 65415, 323, 57399, 279, 7488, 315, 315, 7761, 11, 38781, 11, 35753, 11, 323, 5942, 13, 11733, 5942, 525, 34219, 553, 8225, 11055, 23783, 13, 35324, 9435, 14886, 525, 2989, 304, 2176, 5942, 11, 7892, 862, 1714, 315, 18368, 323, 4879, 43542, 304, 279, 1378, 5942, 13], "logp_list": [-0.755, -0.1754, -0.0089, -0.0432, -0.0002, -0.3936, -0.0001, -0.0007, -0.1266, -0.0059, -0.0001, -0.0008, -0.0027, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0295, -0.0007, -0.0005, -0.002, -0.0009, -0.0003, -0.0015, -0.4767, -0.0067, -0.0025, -0.0002, -0.0003, -0.0007, -0.0039, -0.0003, -0.0003, -0.036, -0.5818, -0.0011, -0.0191, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0009, -0.0023, -0.0197, -0.2849, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0015, -0.0011, -0.0001, -0.0022, -0.0273, -0.0039, -0.0003, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.1073, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0007, -0.0016, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0022, -0.0562], "cumulative_logprob": -3.1938, "norm_logp": -0.0507, "input_len": 278, "output_tokens": 63, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 34.59, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "639", "pred": "Pain-killing properties, spicy weight loss alternative, natural nasal decongestant, may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, cardiovascular health benefits.", "raw_output": "Pain-killing properties, spicy weight loss alternative, natural nasal decongestant, may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, cardiovascular health benefits.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, jalapeños have various health benefits such as pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestion, prevention of heart disease and even cancer, being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, they have cardiovascular health benefits.", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 9.128, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 43, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [47, 466, 12646, 9400, 5888, 11, 47251, 4680, 4709, 10555, 11, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 1231, 1492, 5358, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 3359, 11, 323, 9387, 11, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 11, 40613, 2820, 7567, 13], "logp_list": [-1.3666, -0.0011, -0.5008, -0.0007, -0.043, -0.0945, -0.3734, -0.0052, -0.0115, -0.021, -0.0034, -0.0772, -0.0035, -0.0018, -0.0008, -0.0037, -0.0011, -0.0061, -0.2757, -0.0921, -0.0109, -0.0062, -0.0035, -0.0498, -0.0709, -0.011, -0.0796, -0.0603, -0.5254, -0.0176, -0.0283, -0.0003, -0.0007, -0.0026, -0.0004, -0.0087, -0.0266, -0.0003, -0.3022, -1.0517, -0.0075, -0.2232, -0.3524], "cumulative_logprob": -5.7233, "norm_logp": -0.1331, "input_len": 279, "output_tokens": 43, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 48.15, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "644", "pred": "Cut large, sprouted potato into chunks with two or three eyes each, using a sharp knife, being careful to not break the long sprouts. Place the potato chunks on a tray or cookie sheet, and set them in a cool, dark location overnight so the cut end can dry out. Small potato can be planted whole. Water the potato thoroughly. Continue watering regularly when the soil is dry to the touch. Add a 4-inch layer of mulch around the plants, pulling it back at least 4 inches from the sprouting potato vines. Mul", "raw_output": "Answer: Cut large, sprouted potato into chunks with two or three eyes each, using a sharp knife, being careful to not break the long sprouts. Place the potato chunks on a tray or cookie sheet, and set them in a cool, dark location overnight so the cut end can dry out. Small potato can be planted whole. Water the potato thoroughly. Continue watering regularly when the soil is dry to the touch. Add a 4-inch layer of mulch around the plants, pulling it back at least 4 inches from the sprouting potato vines. Mul", "gt": "To plant a potato that has sprouted, first cut large potatoes into chunks with two or three eyes each, being careful not to break the long sprouts. Place these chunks on a tray and let them dry out in a cool, dark place overnight. Small, sprouted potatoes can be planted whole. Next, prepare your planting area by turning the soil over with a hoe or tiller to a depth of 12 inches, removing any large rocks or debris. Dig a trench about 4 inches wide and 6 to 8 inches deep. Cut your potatoes into cubes of about 1 to 2 inches, making sure to leave a sprout on each cube. Place these cubes in the trench, sprouted side facing up, spaced about 6 to 8 inches apart. Cover the potatoes with compost and then replace the dirt on top of the plantings. Water the potatoes thoroughly and regularly when the soil is dry to the touch. Finally, add a 4-inch layer of mulch around the plants, keeping it at least 4 inches away from the sprouting potato vines. This mulch will help keep the soil cool and maintain a consistent moisture level.", "question": "how to plant a potato that has sprouted", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 23.221, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 114, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [16141, 25, 19649, 3460, 11, 8151, 18533, 38734, 1119, 26757, 448, 1378, 476, 2326, 6414, 1817, 11, 1667, 264, 17232, 21430, 11, 1660, 16585, 311, 537, 1438, 279, 1293, 8151, 11672, 13, 10771, 279, 38734, 26757, 389, 264, 34688, 476, 12544, 10834, 11, 323, 738, 1105, 304, 264, 7010, 11, 6319, 3728, 24398, 773, 279, 3931, 835, 646, 9058, 700, 13, 14994, 38734, 646, 387, 38341, 4361, 13, 9959, 279, 38734, 26364, 13, 15003, 72741, 15502, 979, 279, 17171, 374, 9058, 311, 279, 5796, 13, 2691, 264, 220, 19, 24241, 6193, 315, 15602, 331, 2163, 279, 10779, 11, 22266, 432, 1182, 518, 3245, 220, 19, 14924, 504, 279, 8151, 10909, 38734, 85429, 13, 29351], "logp_list": [-1.0678, -0.0227, -0.5184, -0.4554, -0.0176, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0165, -0.0008, -0.0064, -0.0408, -0.0036, -0.0006, -0.0003, -0.0031, -0.0052, -0.0523, -0.0867, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0178, -0.0318, -0.0001, -0.0033, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0009, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0048, -0.0131, -0.0012, -0.0017, -0.0003, -0.001, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0006, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0029, -0.001, -0.0007, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0003, -0.0005, -0.0003, -0.0003, -0.0051, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.003, -0.0003, -0.0006, -0.0018, -0.0025, -0.044, -0.0184, -0.0015, -0.0038, -0.0037, -0.0007, -0.0243, -1.0503, -0.0151, -0.0271, -0.0069, -0.0051, -0.0087, -0.0008, -0.003, -0.0011, -0.0003, -0.001, -0.0004, -0.0002, -0.0018, -0.0005, -0.0011, -0.0017, -0.0168, -0.0013, -0.0012, -0.0007, -0.0105, -0.0002, -0.0004, -0.0005, -0.0001, -0.0017, -0.0002, -0.0017, -0.0007, -0.0015, -0.0008, -0.0001, -0.0005, -0.0031, -0.0009, -0.0025, -0.