{"id": "701", "pred": "children learn about floating and sinking and seeing that different objects can sink and float.", "raw_output": "children learn about floating and sinking and seeing that different objects can sink and float.", "gt": "Children learn various skills and concepts through water play. It aids in the development of gross motor skills as they engage in activities like running through sprinklers or filling and pouring water from buckets. Water play also facilitates academic learning in areas such as science and math. Children learn about the concept of floating and sinking, and understand that different objects have different buoyancies. In math, they learn about measurement by determining the amount of water that fits into a bucket, and concepts of more and less by comparing water levels in different buckets. Water play also promotes creativity, allowing children to use their imagination.", "question": "what do children learn with water play", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 3.324, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 16, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [5864, 3960, 911, 19057, 323, 61093, 323, 9120, 429, 2155, 6171, 646, 19309, 323, 2224, 13], "logp_list": [-0.4061, -0.3512, -0.6909, -0.3525, -0.0635, -0.0083, -1.1559, -0.0948, -0.0258, -0.0049, -0.0047, -0.0021, -0.0029, -0.0059, -0.0033, -0.9507], "cumulative_logprob": -4.1235, "norm_logp": -0.2577, "input_len": 371, "output_tokens": 16, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "709", "pred": "The colors of the Tennessee flag are extremely significant. White is a symbol of purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "raw_output": "The colors of the Tennessee flag are extremely significant. White is a symbol of purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here is the answer to the question:\n\nThe colors of the Tennessee flag have the following meanings:\n\n* White represents purity\n* Blue represents patriotism\n* Red represents the willingness to shed blood during warfare\n\nThe three white stars on the flag represent the three grand divisions of Tennessee: East, Middle, and West. The blue field with the white stars is meant to symbolize the three divisions bound together as one.", "question": "what do the colors of the tennessee flag mean", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 9.489, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 42, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 7987, 315, 279, 23219, 5181, 525, 9016, 5089, 13, 5807, 374, 264, 7735, 315, 52400, 11, 6303, 13352, 369, 279, 89342, 315, 279, 1251, 315, 23219, 323, 2518, 13352, 369, 279, 61692, 315, 279, 1251, 311, 24354, 6543, 2337, 38207, 13], "logp_list": [-0.462, -0.1174, -0.1935, -0.0027, -0.0011, -0.0407, -1.9828, -0.1875, -0.0015, -0.0866, -0.0813, -1.0521, -0.0054, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0267, -0.0069, -0.0037, -0.0, -0.0024, -0.0008, -0.0012, -0.0003, -0.0008, -0.0072, -0.0005, -0.4293, -0.0006, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0011, -0.0008, -0.0004, -0.0005, -0.0001, -0.0011, -0.0007, -0.0001, -0.0022, -0.0005, -0.0174], "cumulative_logprob": -4.7208, "norm_logp": -0.1124, "input_len": 580, "output_tokens": 42, "eval_metric