{"id": "34", "pred": "Preheat oven to 350 degrees f (175 degrees c). Season the pollock fillets with paprika and black pepper. Bake in preheated oven until fish has cooked and flakes easily, about 15 minutes. Turn oven off", "raw_output": "Preheat oven to 350 degrees f (175 degrees c). Season the pollock fillets with paprika and black pepper. Bake in preheated oven until fish has cooked and flakes easily, about 15 minutes. Turn oven off", "gt": "To cook pollock, preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Season the pollock fillets with paprika and black pepper. Place the fillets on a baking sheet sprayed with butter flavored cooking spray. Optionally, layer the fillets with onion, green pepper, and tomato slices. Bake in the preheated oven for about 15 minutes, or until the fish is cooked and flakes easily. If desired, turn off the oven, place two slices of cheese on each fillet, and return the fish to the oven for approximately 3 minutes to allow the cheese to melt.", "question": "how to cook pollock?", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 10.426, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 53, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [4703, 19963, 23387, 311, 220, 18, 20, 15, 12348, 282, 320, 16, 22, 20, 12348, 272, 568, 14263, 279, 1471, 1023, 1461, 9942, 448, 25298, 40454, 323, 3691, 24353, 13, 52074, 304, 855, 383, 657, 23387, 3080, 7640, 702, 29105, 323, 81623, 6707, 11, 911, 220, 16, 20, 4420, 13, 11999, 23387, 1007], "logp_list": [-0.9853, -0.0022, -0.3049, -0.0235, -0.0138, -0.2225, -0.0016, -0.0008, -0.0087, -0.1057, -0.0619, -0.002, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0008, -0.0089, -0.1674, -0.2041, -0.0547, -0.0035, -0.0004, -0.0006, -0.0009, -0.002, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0011, -0.0005, -0.0006, -0.0157, -0.0284, -0.0067, -0.0075, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0114, -0.0053, -0.169, -0.0002, -0.0006, -0.0009, -0.0001, -0.0044, -0.0016, -0.0011, -0.0027, -