{"id": "52", "pred": "Benefits of a Water Pik include helping to maintain good oral health by massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis, and cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas area that brushing can not access.", "raw_output": "Benefits of a Water Pik include helping to maintain good oral health by massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis, and cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas area that brushing can not access.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include maintaining good oral health, reducing the risk of gingivitis, cleaning better around the teeth and gums, and eliminating tough-to-remove germs and plaque from the gum line.", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 10.442, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 51, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [84323, 315, 264, 9959, 61162, 2924, 10476, 311, 10306, 1661, 20655, 2820, 553, 3072, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 17719, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 11, 323, 15826, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 3082, 429, 76726, 646, 537, 2615, 13], "logp_list": [-0.957, -0.0222, -0.0504, -0.6937, -0.0923, -0.1737, -1.2009, -0.0543, -0.1234, -0.0105, -0.0006, -0.0071, -0.9985, -0.0459, -0.0001, -0.0013, -0.0021, -0.0145, -0.0077, -0.0879, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.1508, -0.3905, -0.0005, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0561, -0.0151, -0.0016, -0.0102, -0.0629, -0.0546, -0.5864, -0.0069, -0.0183, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0001, -0.3838, -0.0056, -0.7797, -0.0236, -0.4799, -0.3745, -0.0033, -0.0545, -0.1567, -0.0039, -0.0033, -0.018], "cumulative_logprob": -8.1859, "norm_logp": -0.1605, "input_len": 317, "output_tokens": 51, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 52.63, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "57", "pred": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keep the birds from reaching those spaces they often", "raw_output": "Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keep the birds from reaching those spaces they often", "gt": "To prevent birds from building a nest on your porch, you can attach bird netting to the eves and top of your porch with staples. Additionally, you can install bird netting over your light fixture to deter birds from accessing it. Another option is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away. It's important to note that any product used to deter birds should be nonflammable and safe to use.", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 10.814, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 55, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [30485, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 2506, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545], "logp_list": [-0.3129, -0.29, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0616, -0.0084, -0.0129, -0.0011, -0.0539, -0.0083, -0.0041, -0.0039, -0.0122, -0.0001, -0.0939, -0.0006, -0.0012, -0.002, -0.2395, -0.8537, -0.0052, -0.0006, -0.0546, -0.0146, -0.0007, -0.0009, -0.0014, -0.0004, -0.0009, -0.0004, -0.0005, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0005, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0112, -0.3131,