{"id": "245", "pred": "The difference between FEHA and ADA is that the ADA applies to all employers in the private sector that have four to fifteen employees, whereas the FEHA affects more employees, and it doesn’t distinguish between private and public employers like", "raw_output": "The difference between FEHA and ADA is that the ADA applies to all employers in the private sector that have four to fifteen employees, whereas the FEHA affects more employees, and it doesn’t distinguish between private and public employers like", "gt": "One difference between FEHA and ADA is that the ADA applies to all private sector employers with four to fifteen employees, while FEHA affects more employees and doesn't distinguish between private and public employers like ADA does.", "question": "difference between feha and ada", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 8.839, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 45, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 6672, 1948, 27931, 17020, 323, 78325, 374, 429, 279, 78325, 16790, 311, 678, 22426, 304, 279, 869, 10486, 429, 614, 3040, 311, 36655, 8256, 11, 19853, 279, 27931, 17020, 21501, 803, 8256, 11, 323, 432, 3171, 1405, 32037, 1948, 869, 323, 584, 22426, 1075], "logp_list": [-1.3182, -0.8005, -0.0169, -0.4456, -0.0004, -0.1145, -0.0574, -0.1809, -0.0329, -0.7643, -0.1017, -0.0341, -0.015, -0.2216, -0.0129, -0.0103, -0.0056, -0.0012, -0.0016, -0.0424, -0.0216, -0.0026, -0.0004, -0.0004, -0.0011, -0.0367, -0.0292, -0.0144, -0.0004, -0.0003, -0.0148, -0.0015, -0.0011, -0.038, -0.0055, -0.0019, -0.0007, -0.5937, -0.0043, -0.0004, -0.0002, -0.0005, -0.0012, -0.0012, -0.0186], "cumulative_logprob": -4.9687, "norm_logp": -0.1104, "input_len": 266, "output_tokens": 45, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 86.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "250", "pred": "Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate. In a bowl, mix together the seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavor flavor until thoroughly combined. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes. Grill the chops that indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.", "raw_output": "Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate. In a bowl, mix together the seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavor flavor until thoroughly combined. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. With your hands, massage the spice rub into the meat; allow to stand for 10 minutes. Grill the chops that indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.", "gt": "To grill pork chops according to allrecipes.com, preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat and lightly oil the grate. In a bowl, mix together seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring. Rinse the pork chops and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. Massage the spice rub into the meat and let it stand for 10 minutes. Grill the chops over indirect heat for about 12 minutes per side or until they are no longer pink inside.", "question": "how to grill pork chops, allrecipes.com", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 21.629, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 109, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [4703, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 11051, 8628, 11, 323, 33404, 5590, 279, 85354, 13, 758, 264, 19212, 11, 6514, 3786, 279, 51514, 12021, 