{"id": "256", "pred": "To clean your dryer vent, remove the outside cover on the vent, and use a special lint brush with an extendable handle to clean the inside of the pipe.", "raw_output": "To clean your dryer vent, remove the outside cover on the vent, and use a special lint brush with an extendable handle to clean the inside of the pipe.", "gt": "To clean your dryer vent, follow these steps:\n\n1. Remove the outside cover on the vent.\n2. Use a special lint brush with an extendable handle to clean the inside of the pipe.\n3. If possible, remove the bottom front panel of the dryer and clean there as well.\n4. Pay attention to the area around the lint filter and clean it thoroughly.\n5. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.", "question": "how to clean dryer vent", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 8.374, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 33, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 4240, 697, 46622, 10378, 11, 4057, 279, 4889, 3421, 389, 279, 10378, 11, 323, 990, 264, 3281, 57920, 15625, 448, 458, 13036, 480, 3705, 311, 4240, 279, 4766, 315, 279, 13647, 13], "logp_list": [-0.5767, -0.0025, -0.6985, -0.0022, -0.0011, -0.0187, -0.4791, -0.0002, -0.0071, -0.0132, -0.0084, -0.0002, -0.0004, -0.1279, -0.0236, -0.0082, -0.0008, -0.0007, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0013, -0.0005, -0.0012, -0.0005, -0.0018, -0.0001, -0.0009, -0.0002, -0.0007, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0081], "cumulative_logprob": -1.9858, "norm_logp": -0.0602, "input_len": 491, "output_tokens": 33, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 53.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "261", "pred": "MSM powder benefits the body by helping to get oxygen into the blood a lot more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels, helping to absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals), relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "raw_output": "MSM powder benefits the body by helping to get oxygen into the blood a lot more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels, helping to absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals), relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "gt": "The benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in the absorption of nutrients, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 11.819, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 61, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [4826, 44, 16723, 7567, 279, 2487, 553, 10476, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 264, 2696, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 11, 7703, 4802, 5866, 11, 10476, 311, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 701, 58544, 4405, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 11, 323, 17719, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 13], "logp_list": [-1.3569, -0.0003, -0.3481, -0.5603, -0.1942, -0.0039, -0.3897, -0.2007, -0.0513, -0.062, -0.0154, -0.0013, -0.0017, -0.0017, -0.6034, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0536, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.3085, -0.3628, -0.0044, -0.3321, -0.5897, -0.3749, -0.915, -0.158, -0.0114, -0.0018, -0.6025, -0.0085, -0.0183, 