{"id": "271", "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, bloating, spotting, and cramping.", "raw_output": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, bloating, spotting, and cramping.", "gt": "The earliest signs of pregnancy often include mood swings and unusual emotional behavior due to a flood of hormones in the body. Dizziness can also occur as pregnancy causes blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Other early symptoms can include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. Approximately half of all pregnant women experience nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experience nausea without vomiting, with these symptoms typically starting around six weeks after their last period.", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 5.255, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 23, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 19671, 56790, 11, 294, 96645, 11, 14211, 1095, 11, 89219, 11, 323, 1560, 30457, 13], "logp_list": [-1.0548, -0.0545, -0.026, -0.2524, -0.0001, -0.002, -0.0005, -0.8654, -0.2322, -0.0005, -0.1702, -0.263, -0.0002, -0.013, -0.8271, -0.0001, -0.001, -0.0023, -0.0039, -0.388, -0.0008, -0.0005, -0.0244], "cumulative_logprob": -4.1829, "norm_logp": -0.1819, "input_len": 259, "output_tokens": 23, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "279", "pred": "Severe osteoporosis is a condition that virtually no symptoms until severe bone damage has already occurred. Once the bones have been weakened by bone density loss, symptoms may include: 1  Back pain.2  Loss of height over time with stooped posture. 3  Fractures of the vertebrae, wrists,", "raw_output": "Severe osteoporosis is a condition that virtually no symptoms until severe bone damage has already occurred. Once the bones have been weakened by bone density loss, symptoms may include: 1  Back pain.2  Loss of height over time with stooped posture. 3  Fractures of the vertebrae, wrists,", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, severe osteoporosis refers to a condition where there is significant bone density loss, leading to symptoms such as sudden and severe back pain, loss of height, and an increased risk of fractures, particularly in the spine, hips, and wrists.", "question": "what is severe osteoporosis", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 13.149, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 67, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 264, 2971, 429, 21214, 902, 13495, 3080, 15386, 17240, 5557, 702, 2669, 10017, 13, 9646, 279, 24854, 614, 1012, 57664, 553, 17240, 17457, 4709, 11, 13495, 1231, 2924, 25, 220, 16, 220, 6841, 6646, 13, 17, 220, 24704, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 42032, 16367, 47278, 13, 220, 18, 220, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11], "logp_list": [-0.4546, -0.0003, -0.0059, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.8968, -1.1135, -0.0109, -0.8744, -0.9025, -0.1524, -0.0012, -0.0264, -0.024, -0.0027, -0.0043, -0.3608, -0.0198, -0.0009, -0.0204, -0.9922, -0.001, -0.0013, -0.0027, -0.0024, -0.0009, -0.0021, -0.0015, -0.0009, -0.0021, -0.0429, -0.0109, -0.0045, -0.0022, -0.1969, -0.2691, -0.0063, -0.6287, -0.0171, -0.0005, -0.0263, -0.1728, -0.0076, -0.0009, -0.0002, -0.0002