{"id": "546", "pred": "People born in October are have a great interest in, and eye for, form and structure. They would make a good architect, interior decorator, designer, or any profession that combines art and structure.", "raw_output": "People born in October are have a great interest in, and eye for, form and structure. They would make a good architect, interior decorator, designer, or any profession that combines art and structure.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some traits associated with people born in October:\n\n* Interest in form and structure (Passage 1)\n* Success-oriented and charming (Passage 2)\n* Personal power and impatience (Passage 2)\n* Crave stability and security (Passage 3)\n\nHowever, it's important to note that these are generalizations based on astrological signs and not all individuals will exhibit these traits. Additionally, there is no information about specific personality traits or characteristics of people born in October. Therefore, I cannot provide a more detailed answer based solely on the given passages.", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 8.011, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 40, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [15919, 9223, 304, 6527, 525, 614, 264, 2244, 2734, 304, 11, 323, 7912, 369, 11, 1352, 323, 5944, 13, 2379, 1035, 1281, 264, 1661, 11470, 11, 14791, 50678, 11, 14692, 11, 476, 894, 4808, 429, 32411, 1947, 323, 5944, 13], "logp_list": [-0.5094, -0.3199, -0.0032, -0.0055, -1.0746, -0.1551, -0.3165, -0.0163, -0.0049, -0.0095, -0.2755, -0.0023, -0.0129, -0.001, -0.0066, -0.0035, -0.0037, -0.0009, -0.278, -0.5396, -0.9705, -0.0058, -0.0492, -0.0028, -0.0008, -0.0043, -0.0009, -0.0013, -0.0025, -0.0059, -0.014, -0.001, -0.0007, -0.0017, -0.0009, -0.0341, -0.0004, -0.0066, -0.0008, -0.0227], "cumulative_logpro