{"id": "636", "pred": "Both the nervous system and endocrine system are devoted to maintaining homeostasis by coordinating and regulating the activities of of cells, tissues, organs, and systems. Both systems are regulated by negative feedback mechanisms. Chemical messengers are important in both systems, although their method of transmission and release differs in the two systems.", "raw_output": "Both the nervous system and endocrine system are devoted to maintaining homeostasis by coordinating and regulating the activities of of cells, tissues, organs, and systems. Both systems are regulated by negative feedback mechanisms. Chemical messengers are important in both systems, although their method of transmission and release differs in the two systems.", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the key differences and similarities between the nervous system and the endocrine system:\n\nDifferences:\n\n* The nervous system is made of neuron cells, while the endocrine system is made of glands.\n* Transmission in the nervous system occurs through electrochemical pulses, while in the endocrine system, it is done through chemicals called hormones.\n* The nervous system is continuous and interconnected, while the endocrine system consists of discrete organs.\n* The nervous system uses neurons to transmit signals, while the endocrine system uses the circulatory system.\n\nSimilarities:\n\n* Both systems are devoted to maintaining homeostasis by coordinating and regulating the activities of other cells, tissues, organs, and systems.\n* Both systems are regulated by negative feedback mechanisms.\n* Chemical messengers are important in both systems, although their method of transmission and release differs.\n\nTherefore, based on the given passages, the nervous system and endocrine system have different structures and methods of transmission, but they share similar functions and regulatory mechanisms.", "question": "similarity and difference between nervous system and endocrine system", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 12.388, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 63, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [20629, 279, 22596, 1849, 323, 835, 77638, 1849, 525, 28229, 311, 20337, 2114, 535, 10718, 553, 65415, 323, 57399, 279, 7488, 315, 315, 7761, 11, 38781, 11, 35753, 11, 323, 5942, 13, 11733, 5942, 525, 34219, 553, 8225, 11055, 23783, 13, 35324, 9435, 14886, 525, 2989, 304, 2176, 5942, 11, 7892, 862, 1714, 315, 18368, 323, 4879, 43542, 304, 279, 1378, 5942, 13], "logp_list": [-0.755, -0.1754, -0.0089, -0.0432, -0.0002, -0.3936, -0.0001, -0.0007, -0.1266, -0.0059, -0.0001, -0.0008, -0.0027, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0295, -0.0007, -0.0005, -0.002, -0.0009, -0.0003, -0.0015, -0.4767, -0.0067, -0.0025, -0.0002, -0.0003, -0.0007, -0.0039, -0.0003, -0.0003, -0.036, -0.5818, -0.0011, -0.0191, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0009, -0.0023, -0.0197, -0.2849, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0015, -0.0011, -0.0001, -0.0022, -0.0273, -0.0039, -0.0003, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.1073, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0007, -0.0016, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0022, -0.0562], "cumulative_logprob": -3.1938, "norm_logp": -0.0507, "input_len": 278, "output_tokens": 63, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 45.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "640", "pred": "Pain-killing properties, spicy weight loss alternative, natural nasal decongestant, may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, cardiovascular health benefits.", "raw_output": "Pain-killing properties, spicy weight loss alternative, natural nasal decongestant, may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, cardiovascular health benefits.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some health benefits of jalapenos:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Natural nasal decongestant\n* May help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer\n* Good source of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants\n* Cardiovascular health benefits, including defending against heart health concerns and increasing cardiovascular health benefits.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What are the health benefits of jalapenos?\" can be summarized as:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Nasal decongestant\n* Anti-cancer properties\n* Cardiovascular health benefits\n* Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 8.904, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 43, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [47, 466, 12646, 9400, 5888, 11, 47251, 4680, 4709, 10555, 11, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 1231, 1492, 5358, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 3359, 11, 323, 9387, 11, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 11, 40613, 2820, 7567, 13], "logp_list": [-1.3666, -0.0011, -0.5008, -0.0007, -0.043, -0.0945, -0.3734, -0.0052, -0.0115, -0.021, -0.0034, -0.0772, -0.0035, -0.0018, -0.0008, -0.0037, -0.0011, -0.0061, -0.2757, -0.0921, -0.0109, -0.0062, -0.0035, -0.0498, -0.0709, -0.011, -0.0796, -0.0603, -0.5254, -0.0176, -0.0283, -0.0003, -0.0007, -0.0026, -0.0004, -0.0087, -0.0266, -0.0003, -0.3022, -1.0517, -0.0075, -0.2232, -0.3524], "cumulative_logprob": -5.7233, "norm_logp": -0.1331, "input_len": 279, "output_tokens": 43, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 44.94, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "645", "pred": "Cut large, sprouted potato into chunks with two or three eyes each, using a sharp knife, being careful to not break the long sprouts. Place the potato chunks on a tray or cookie sheet, and set them in a cool, dark location overnight so the cut end can dry out. Small potato can be planted whole. Water the potato thoroughly. Continue watering regularly when the soil is dry to the touch. Add a 4-inch layer of mulch around the plants, pulling it back at least 4 inches from the sprouting potato vines. Mul", "raw_output": "Answer: Cut large, sprouted potato into chunks with two or three eyes each, using a sharp knife, being careful to not break the long sprouts. Place the potato chunks on a tray or cookie sheet, and set them in a cool, dark location overnight so the cut end can dry out. Small potato can be planted whole. Water the potato thoroughly. Continue watering regularly when the soil is dry to the touch. Add a 4-inch layer of mulch around the plants, pulling it back at least 4 inches from the sprouting potato vines. Mul", "gt": "To plant a sprouted potato, cut it into chunks with two or three eyes each. Place the potato chunks on a tray or cookie sheet and let them dry out overnight. Dig a trench about 4 inches wide and 6 to 8 inches deep in a prepared planting area. Place the sprouted or eye side of the potato chunks facing up, separating each chunk by about 6 to 8 inches. Cover the potatoes with a layer of compost and then replace the dirt on top. Water the potatoes thoroughly and continue watering regularly when the soil is dry to the touch. Add a 4-inch layer of mulch around the plants to keep the soil cool and maintain moisture.", "question": "how to plant a potato that has sprouted", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 22.306, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 114, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [16141, 