{"id": "649", "pred": "The color of urine can vary based on several factors, including the presence of blood, certain foods and medications, and kidney diseases. A normal color of urine is pale yellow, which is due to the pigment urochrome. However, this pale color of urine is sometimes altered when, in case of kidney diseases, the filtration and selective re-absorption stages of urine production are malfunction function", "raw_output": "The color of urine can vary based on several factors, including the presence of blood, certain foods and medications, and kidney diseases. A normal color of urine is pale yellow, which is due to the pigment urochrome. However, this pale color of urine is sometimes altered when, in case of kidney diseases, the filtration and selective re-absorption stages of urine production are malfunction function", "gt": "The color of urine can indicate different health conditions. Red urine may indicate the presence of blood and could be a sign of an infection or cancer. Deep purple urine can be a characteristic of porphyria, a rare disorder. The normal color of urine is pale yellow due to the pigment urochrome.", "question": "color of urin meaning", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 14.999, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 77, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 1894, 315, 39235, 646, 13289, 3118, 389, 3807, 9363, 11, 2670, 279, 9362, 315, 6543, 11, 3654, 15298, 323, 29910, 11, 323, 37942, 18808, 13, 362, 4622, 1894, 315, 39235, 374, 27539, 13753, 11, 892, 374, 4152, 311, 279, 76578, 575, 299, 31902, 13, 4354, 11, 419, 27539, 1894, 315, 39235, 374, 7025, 28752, 979, 11, 304, 1142, 315, 37942, 18808, 11, 279, 74938, 323, 42910, 312, 96410, 65081, 17628, 315, 39235, 5670, 525, 71187, 729], "logp_list": [-0.2917, -0.0261, -0.0022, -0.0233, -0.0528, -1.0328, -1.171, -0.0004, -0.6472, -0.0018, -0.886, -0.073, -0.5647, -0.0345, -0.0019, -0.1356, -0.266, -0.4401, -0.3125, -0.5159, -0.0035, -0.0171, -0.1814, -1.1767, -0.1835, -0.0602, -1.3676, -0.61, -0.5066, -0.5314, -0.0014, -0.0081, -0.0422, -0.0002, -0.5233, -0.7909, -0.0131, -0.019, -0.0001, -0.0098, -0.0003, -0.0038, -0.0, -0.0, -0.012, -0.1881, -0.0, -1.508, -0.1634, -0.0013, -0.0238, -0.0009, -0.1701, -0.0006, -0.0016, -0.0924, -0.106, -0.0008, -0.058, -0.0006, -0.0022, -0.0007, -0.0054, -0.0072, -0.0003, -0.0011, -0.0024, -0.0026, -0.0083, -0.0001, -0.0018, -0.0011, -0.0009, -0.0004, -0.1744, -0.0032, -0.5051], "cumulative_logprob": -15.5745, "norm_logp": -0.2023, "input_len": 243, "output_tokens": 77, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 39.47, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "653", "pred": "Rinse the hair completely and, if the hair is longer, use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo. Allow the conditioner to remain on for a few mintues. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion.", "raw_output": "Rinse the hair completely and, if the hair is longer, use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo. Allow the conditioner to remain on for a few mintues. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion.", "gt": "To properly clean your hair, first select the appropriate shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Ensure your water is warm but not too hot, and thoroughly wet your hair. Apply a bit of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through the hair. If your hair is long, comb through it with your fingers to reduce tangles rather than piling it on your head. Rinse the hair completely and use a wide-tooth comb to remove any tangles. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and let it stay on for a few minutes. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again. Pat dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoid rubbing it with the towel as it can cause damage. For complete drying, a hair dryer can be used.", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 15.749, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 81, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [49, 258, 325, 279, 6869, 6587, 323, 11, 421, 279, 6869, 374, 5021, 11, 990, 264, 6884, 4686, 8767, 3614, 311, 4057, 259, 17248, 323, 10876, 279, 6869, 13, 20552, 264, 64324, 304, 279, 1852, 