{"id": "68", "pred": "The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag", "raw_output": "The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn US flag is to either:\n\n1. Remove the blue field and burn it in a peaceful manner, then bury the ashes.\n2. Fold the flag in the customary triangle fold and burn it in a proper ceremony.\n\nTherefore, the answer is:\n\n1. Remove the blue field and burn it, or\n2. Fold the flag in the customary triangle fold and burn it in a proper ceremony.", "question": "what is the proper way to dispose of a worn usa flag", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 2.158, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 10, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 6169, 1616, 311, 27390, 315, 264, 23704, 7279, 5181], "logp_list": [-0.8823, -0.0292, -0.0072, -0.0018, -0.0007, -0.0001, -0.0024, -0.0004, -0.3738, -0.0009], "cumulative_logprob": -1.2988, "norm_logp": -0.1299, "input_len": 246, "output_tokens": 10, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "77", "pred": "Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat. When hot, lightly oil grate. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer; add the red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper. Pr", "raw_output": "Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat. When hot, lightly oil grate. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer; add the red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper. Pr", "gt": "To cook brats, follow these steps:\n\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grate.\n3. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\n4. Place the bratwurst in a large pot with onions, butter, and beer.\n5. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n6. Remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and continue cooking on the preheated grill for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally.\n7. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "question": "how to cook brats", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 11.591, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 58, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [4703, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 11051, 27561, 8628, 13, 3197, 4017, 11, 33404, 5590, 85354, 13, 46812, 279, 12883, 323, 44597, 304, 264, 3460, 3338, 26, 4446, 311, 264, 43690, 13, 3719, 19052, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 279, 12883, 26, 912, 279, 2518, 24353, 81623, 11, 30635, 16723, 11, 12021, 11, 323, 24353, 13, 2340], "logp_list": [-1.645, -0.0047, -0.4337, -0.003, -0.0005, -0.01, -0.002, -0.0022, -0.0004, -0.1014, -0.7771, -0.0237, -0.0026, -0.0006, -0.0008, -0.3586, -0.0145, -0.2088, -0.0037, -0.0016, -0.0036, -0.0005, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0007, -0.0029, -0.0105, -0.0029, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0024, -0.1036, -0.0002, -0.0007, -0.0026, -0.1035,