{"id": "257", "pred": "To clean your dryer vent, remove the outside cover on the vent, and use a special lint brush with an extendable handle to clean the inside of the pipe.", "raw_output": "To clean your dryer vent, remove the outside cover on the vent, and use a special lint brush with an extendable handle to clean the inside of the pipe.", "gt": "Sure, I can help you with that! Here are the steps to clean a dryer vent based on the provided passages:\n\n1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house (passage 1) and remove it by sliding it out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the exterior (step 2).\n2. Use a dryer vent brush to remove lint from the hole where the vent connects to the dryer (step 3).\n3. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint (step 4).\n4. Clean the lint from the vent and the hole in the back of the dryer using the dryer vent brush (step 4).\n5. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall (step 5).\n6. If desired, remove the bottom front panel of the dryer and clean the area around the lint filter (passage 2).\n7. Use a vacuum nozzle to clean the lint deposits in the area around the lint filter frame (passage 2).\n\nNote: Passage 3 provides additional information but does not provide specific instructions for cleaning the dryer vent. Therefore, these steps are based on the information provided in passages 1-2.", "question": "how to clean dryer vent", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 8.703, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 33, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 4240, 697, 46622, 10378, 11, 4057, 279, 4889, 3421, 389, 279, 10378, 11, 323, 990, 264, 3281, 57920, 15625, 448, 458, 13036, 480, 3705, 311, 4240, 279, 4766, 315, 279, 13647, 13], "logp_list": [-0.5767, -0.0025, -0.6985, -0.0022, -0.0011, -0.0187, -0.4791, -0.0002, -0.0071, -0.0132, -0.0084, -0.0002, -0.0004, -0.1279, -0.0236, -0.0082, -0.0008, -0.0007, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0013, -0.0005, -0.0012, -0.0005, -0.0018, -0.0001, -0.0009, -0.0002, -0.0007, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0081], "cumulative_logprob": -1.9858, "norm_logp": -0.0602, "input_len": 491, "output_tokens": 33, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "264", "pred": "MSM powder benefits the body by helping to get oxygen into the blood a lot more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels, helping to absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals), relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "raw_output": "MSM powder benefits the body by helping to get oxygen into the blood a lot more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels, helping to absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals), relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of MSM powder:\n\n1. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable and allowing nutrients to be absorbed more efficiently.\n2. Helps reduce inflammation and swelling in muscles and joints.\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Enhances the absorption of vitamins and minerals, including Co-enzyme Q10.\n\nNote that the passages do not mention any other specific benefits of MSM powder beyond these points.", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 12.089, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 61, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [4826, 44, 16723, 7567, 279, 2487, 553, 10476, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 264, 2696, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 11, 7703, 4802, 5866, 11, 10476, 311, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 701, 58544, 4405, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 11, 323, 17719, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 13], "logp_list": [-1.3569, -0.0003, -0.3481, -0.5603, -0.1942, -0.0039, -0.3897, -0.2007, -0.0513, -0.062, -0.0154, -0.0013, -0.0017, -0.0017, -0.6034, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0001, -