{"id": "295", "pred": "The proper way to fertilize your grass involves fertilizing at the right time of year, knowing your fertilizer to work best, you'll need to time it so that you fertilize at the beginning of the growing season. This is different for different types of grasses. F", "raw_output": "The proper way to fertilize your grass involves fertilizing at the right time of year, knowing your fertilizer to work best, you'll need to time it so that you fertilize at the beginning of the growing season. This is different for different types of grasses. F", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the proper way to fertilize your grass is to:\n\n1. Fertilize at the right time of year, which is at the beginning of the growing season, and varies for different types of grasses.\n2. Choose a fertilizer that is suitable for your type of grass and soil pH, as determined by a soil test.\n3. Apply the fertilizer in a perpendicular pattern, avoiding over-fertilization, which can be determined by checking if the leaf blades bounce back up after being stepped on.", "question": "what is the proper way to fertilize your grass", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 10.805, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 55, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 6169, 1616, 311, 35114, 551, 697, 16359, 17601, 35114, 4849, 518, 279, 1290, 882, 315, 1042, 11, 14063, 697, 64291, 311, 975, 1850, 11, 498, 3278, 1184, 311, 882, 432, 773, 429, 498, 35114, 551, 518, 279, 7167, 315, 279, 7826, 3200, 13, 1096, 374, 2155, 369, 2155, 4494, 315, 16359, 288, 13, 434], "logp_list": [-0.8373, -0.0839, -0.0024, -0.0006, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0564, -0.0022, -0.4877, -1.7869, -0.0014, -0.0412, -0.0002, -0.083, -0.0004, -0.0186, -0.0436, -0.0689, -0.5066, -0.4969, -0.2921, -0.1166, -0.0432, -0.0539, -0.0874, -0.6288, -0.0222, -0.0007, -0.0014, -0.1356, -0.0016, -0.0045, -0.0016, -0.0032,