{"id": "318", "pred": "You can use your mobile phone to check the status of a tax return.", "raw_output": "Answer: You can use your mobile phone to check the status of a tax return.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, you can check the status of your tax return by:\n\n1. Using the IRS2Go app on your smartphone to check the status of your tax return online.\n2. Checking the status of your tax return over the phone by calling the IRS.\n3. Checking the status of your state tax return online or over the phone.\n\nTo check the status of your tax return, you will need your Social Security number, tax filing status, and the amount of any refund due. If you e-filed your return, you can check the status 24 hours after the IRS acknowledged receipt of your return. If you mailed your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question of how to check taxes were filed is:\n\nYou can check the status of your tax return online or over the phone using the methods described above.", "question": "how can i check taxes were filed", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 4.038, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 17, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [16141, 25, 1446, 646, 990, 697, 6371, 4540, 311, 1779, 279, 2639, 315, 264, 3742, 470, 13], "logp_list": [-0.2656, -0.0216, -0.3132, -0.5578, -0.8322, -0.098, -0.0155, -0.003, -0.0979, -0.004, -0.0102, -0.0026, -0.0037, -0.0186, -0.0014, -0.001, -0.6486], "cumulative_logprob": -2.8949, "norm_logp": -0.1703, "input_len": 465, "output_tokens": 17, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.01, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "325", "pred": "Based on the information provided in the text, homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can work better than the commercial variety because many faux finishes rely on applying a random pattern of texture to your walls, and commercial texture", "raw_output": "Based on the information provided in the text, homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can work better than the commercial variety because many faux finishes rely on applying a random pattern of texture to your walls, and commercial texture", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that patterned rollers can work well for creating textured finishes on walls, as they can produce a random pattern of texture that is often desired in faux finishing techniques. The third passage provides instructions for creating a DIY texture roller by modifying an existing roller pad with rubber bands to create clumps and random patterns, which can be used to apply paint and create a textured finish.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"How well do patterned rollers work?\" is:\n\nThey can work well for creating textured finishes on walls, especially when used with faux finishing techniques.", "question": "how well do patterned rollers work", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 8.225, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 41, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 1467, 11, 35333, 10434, 476, 45436, 6177, 88613, 646, 975, 2664, 1091, 279, 8353, 8045, 1576, 1657, 50427, 33036, 17188, 389, 18950, 264, 4194, 5383, 315, 10434, 311, 697, 14285, 11, 323, 8353, 10434], "logp_list": [-1.9472, -0.0004, -0.0056, -0.5061, -0.0329, -0.4875, -0.0227, -0.7808, -0.0281, -1.582, -0.1482, -0.0251, -0.0026, -0.0046, -0.0006, -0.5596, -0.125, -0.4863, -0.0232, -0.4297, -0.0002, -0.0035, -1.0466, -0.5831, -0.0004, -0.0015, -0.0041, -0.0, -0.0021, 