{"id": "463", "pred": "The benefits of cupping massage include:\n\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way", "raw_output": "The benefits of cupping massage include:\n\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include eliminating toxins from the body, improving circulation, providing pain relief, increasing range of motion and flexibility, controlling pain, and decreasing anxiety and depression.", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 4.67, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 23, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616], "logp_list": [-1.3198, -0.166, -0.0084, -0.06, -0.0109, -0.0454, -0.1644, -1.5595, -0.2271, -0.0491, -0.0683, -0.6891, -0.0001, -0.0026, -0.1053, -0.0573, -0.0411, -0.0014, -0.0031, -0.1221, -0.0385, -0.0003, -0.0029], "cumulative_logprob": -4.7427, "norm_logp": -0.2062, "input_len": 256, "output_tokens": 23, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.78, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.3, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "470", "pred": "Outdoor hiking has a myriad of benefits for both the body and the mind. Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, so you can participate no matter how fit you currently are", "raw_output": "Answer: Outdoor hiking has a myriad of benefits for both the body and the mind. Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, so you can participate no matter how fit you currently are", "gt": "Sure, here are some benefits of hiking as a hobby mentioned in the passages:\n\n* Promotes mental health\n* Increases levels of vitamin D\n* Cardiovascular benefits, such as reducing the risk of heart disease and increasing overall fitness\n* Positive impact on combating symptoms of stress and anxiety\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 7.378, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 37, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [16141, 25, 32682, 37364, 702, 264, 51809, 315, 7567, 369, 2176, 279, 2487, 323, 279, 3971, 13, 472, 19233, 374, 43152, 323, 4135, 311, 1191, 11, 773, 498, 646, 15759, 902, 4925, 1246, 4946, 498, 5023, 525], "logp_list": [-0.9131, -0.1201, -0.913, -0.0112, -1.1703, -0.0765, -0.0077, -0.0018, -0.0002, -0.0076, -0.0009, -0.0012, -0.0003, -0.0005, -0.0016, -0.0, -0.1642, -0.8946, -0.0001, -0.0943, -0.036, -0.0037, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0348, -0.0168, -0.0007, -0.0002, -0.0005, -0.0042, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0025, -0.0026, -0.0445], "cumulative_logprob": -4.5268, "norm_logp": -0.1223, "input_len": 286, "output_tokens": 37, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.27, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
