{"id": "539", "pred": "He was a friend of mine he was a friend of mine. He died without a penny he didn't have a dime he was a friend of mine. He died neath the midnight sun he died neath the midnight sun.", "raw_output": "He was a friend of mine he was a friend of mine. He died without a penny he didn't have a dime he was a friend of mine. He died neath the midnight sun he died neath the midnight sun.", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the lyrics \"he was a friend of mine\" are mentioned in the following passages:\n\n* Passage 1: In the context of the Greenbriar Boys recording the song \"He Was a Friend of Mine\" with singer Dian James in 1963.\n* Passage 2: As part of a fragmented repetition of the line \"He was a friend of mine\" in the passage.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question is:\n\nPassage 1 and Passage 2", "question": "lyrics he was a friend of mine", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 9.895, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 46, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1519, 572, 264, 4238, 315, 10485, 566, 572, 264, 4238, 315, 10485, 13, 1260, 8469, 2041, 264, 49069, 566, 3207, 944, 614, 264, 73853, 566, 572, 264, 4238, 315, 10485, 13, 1260, 8469, 834, 587, 279, 32333, 7015, 566, 8469, 834, 587, 279, 32333, 7015, 13], "logp_list": [-0.4889, -0.0709, -0.0015, -0.0014, -0.001, -0.0015, -1.2713, -0.0839, -0.0013, -0.006, -0.0026, -0.0009, -0.2581, -0.1865, -0.0059, -0.0022, -0.0021, -0.0004, -0.0282, -0.0129, -0.0207, -0.0034, -0.0043, -0.0001, -0.1066, -0.0342, -0.004, -0.0016, -0.0003, -0.0004, -0.0196, -0.0266, -0.0008, -0.0017, -0.002, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0011, -0.0731, -0.001, -0.0002, -0.0012, -0.0007, -0.0004, -0.0004, -0.1052], "cumulative_logprob": -2.8375, "norm_logp": -0.0617, "input_len": 375, "output_tokens": 46, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.47, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GA