{"id": "547", "pred": "People born in October are have a great interest in, and eye for, form and structure. They would make a good architect, interior decorator, designer, or any profession that combines art and structure.", "raw_output": "People born in October are have a great interest in, and eye for, form and structure. They would make a good architect, interior decorator, designer, or any profession that combines art and structure.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some traits associated with people born in October:\n\n* A keen eye for form and structure (October 14)\n* Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful (October 1)\n* Restless at heart but craving stability and security (October 5)\n\nIt's important to note that these are generalizations and not necessarily applicable to every individual born in October.", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 8.124, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 40, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [15919, 9223, 304, 6527, 525, 614, 264, 2244, 2734, 304, 11, 323, 7912, 369, 11, 1352, 323, 5944, 13, 2379, 1035, 1281, 264, 1661, 11470, 11, 14791, 50678, 11, 14692, 11, 476, 894, 4808, 429, 32411, 1947, 323, 5944, 13], "logp_list": [-0.5094, -0.3199, -0.0032, -0.0055, -1.0746, -0.1551, -0.3165, -0.0163, -0.0049, -0.0095, -0.2755, -0.0023, -0.0129, -0.001, -0.0066, -0.0035, -0.0037, -0.0009, -0.278, -0.5396, -0.9705, -0.0058, -0.0492, -0.0028, -0.0008, -0.0043, -0.0009, -0.0013, -0.0025, -0.0059, -0.014, -0.001, -0.0007, -0.0017, -0.0009, -0.0341, -0.0004, -0.0066, -0.0008, -0.0227], "cumulative_logprob": -4.6658, "norm_logp": -0.1166, "input_len": 311, "output_tokens": 40, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "554", "pred": "Oracle has 2 CEOs because Larry Ellison unexpectedly announced that he was stepping down from his CEO post and naming not one, but two CEOs to replace him. Co-president and CFO Safra Catz and co-president Mark Hurd will share the role of CEO.", "raw_output": "Oracle has 2 CEOs because Larry Ellison unexpectedly announced that he was stepping down from his CEO post and naming not one, but two CEOs to replace him. Co-president and CFO Safra Catz and co-president Mark Hurd will share the role of CEO.", "gt": "Oracle has two CEOs because the former CEO, Larry Ellison, stepped down and chose to have two of his co-presidents, Safra Catz and Mark Hurd, share the role of CEO.", "question": "why does the company Oracle have 2 CEOs", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 10.859, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 52, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [48663, 702, 220, 17, 74217, 1576, 29290, 81647, 50609, 7228, 429, 566, 572, 35467, 1495, 504, 806, 12156, 1736, 323, 34948, 537, 825, 11, 714, 1378, 74217, 311, 8290, 1435, 13, 3539, 65988, 323, 93752, 12582, 956, 17358, 89, 323, 1062, 65988, 4389, 472, 16081, 686, 4332, 279, 3476, 315, 12156, 13], "logp_list": [-0.132, -0.6983, -0.3696, -0.0009, -0.0106, -0.1875, -0.0968, -0.003, -1.0813, -0.0084, -0.1538, -0.0022, -0.8472, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0258, -0.0009, -0.0017, -0.0044, -0.0657, -0.3185, -0.2516, -0.0006, -0.0106, -0.0002, -0.0013, -0.0098, -0.0447, -0.002, -0.0002, -0.0983, -0.2546, -0.0174, -0.0256, -0.0003, -0.0011, -0.4381, -0.002, -0.0152, -0.0024, -0.0015, -0.0006, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0046, -0.0028, -0.0001, -0.002, -0.0024, -0.0003, -0.0068], "cumulative_logprob": -5.2063, "norm_logp": -0.1001, "input_len": 384, "output_tokens": 52, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 58.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "573", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This is a", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This is a", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can start by identifying all possible entry points that mice use to get into your house. Once identified, consider putting steel wool inside these holes or vents before sealing them off. This will prevent the mice from using these paths to re-enter your home. By doing so, you eliminate their access to food or shelter in your house, which can help in getting rid of them quickly.", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 3.498, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 17, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 374, 264], "logp_list": [-1.4829, -0.0525, -0.0563, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0268, -0.9429, -0.1799, -0.0017, -0.0215, -0.0013, -0.0016, -0.5001, -0.7367, -0.0734, -0.0284], "cumulative_logprob": -4.1065, "norm_logp": -0.2416, "input_len": 272, "output_tokens": 17, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "580", "pred": "If your Sperrys shoes get wet, you can use a suede bar and leather brush to clean them.", "raw_output": "If your Sperrys shoes get wet, you can use a suede bar and leather brush to clean them.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, if your Sperry shoes get wet, it is recommended to use a leather conditioner to help revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. This is especially important if you wash your shoes with detergent, as it tends to dry out the leather. If you don't have a leather conditioner on hand, you can use a suede bar or leather brush to clean the shoes. It's best to avoid getting light tan Sperry shoes wet, as water might stain them. However, if you do get them wet, using a suede bar or leather brush should help remove any stains.", "question": "what do i do if i got my sperrys wet", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 4.963, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 22, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [2679, 697, 3089, 615, 1047, 15294, 633, 14401, 11, 498, 646, 990, 264, 96635, 3619, 323, 17553, 15625, 311, 4240, 1105, 13], "logp_list": [-1.088, -0.7442, -0.0409, -0.5766, -0.0362, -0.4534, -0.2999, -0.0002, -0.0065, -0.3293, -0.3941, -1.0598, -0.3397, -0.1022, -0.0137, -0.3662, -0.1468, -0.0022, -0.3775, -0.1074, -0.2848, -0.3365], "cumulative_logprob": -7.1061, "norm_logp": -0.323, "input_len": 274, "output_tokens": 22, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.55, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
