lash"}}
{"id": "670", "pred": "The weighted average method of inventory costing assigns an average cost to each piece of inventory when it is", "raw_output": "The weighted average method of inventory costing assigns an average cost to each piece of inventory when it is", "gt": "The weighted average method of inventory costing assigns an average cost to each item of inventory when it is sold. This is calculated by taking the average cost of all inventories currently available. This cost fluctuates as inventory prices change. The weighted average cost per unit is determined by dividing the cost of goods available for sale by the number of units available for sale. This cost is then assigned to both ending inventory and the cost of goods sold. This method is often used when it's impossible to assign specific costs to individual units or when the accounting system isn't sophisticated enough to track FIFO or LIFO inventory layers. The recorded amount of inventory on hand using this method represents a value between the oldest and newest units purchased into stock.", "question": "inventory costing weighted average", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 4.198, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 19, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 36824, 5461, 1714, 315, 15444, 53724, 49912, 458, 5461, 2783, 311, 1817, 6573, 315, 15444, 979, 432, 374], "logp_list": [-0.6447, -0.2266, -0.0088, -0.0671, -0.3579, -0.4354, -0.0046, -0.155, -0.0755, -0.0001, -0.0032, -0.0124, -0.0027, -0.0613, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0264, -0.0019, -0.0003], "cumulative_logprob": -2.0839, "norm_logp": -0.1097, "input_len": 482, "output_tokens": 19, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.68, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "677", "pred": "The benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses and relieving stress in the body, providing relief from stress when mixed with basil, mint, and cardamom in water and taken with honey. Clove tea also has analgesse qualities that work well for those suffering from gas pain or stomach upset, stimulating blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion. Additionally, clove tea compresses are an excellent way to relieve pain from any muscle, joint or ligament injury when applied to unbroken skin", "raw_output": "The benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses and relieving stress in the body, providing relief from stress when mixed with basil, mint, and cardamom in water and taken with honey. Clove tea also has analgesse qualities that work well for those suffering from gas pain or stomach upset, stimulating blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion. Additionally, clove tea compresses are an excellent way to relieve pain from any muscle, joint or ligament injury when applied to unbroken skin", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, providing relief from abdominal pain and aiding digestion. The side effects of drinking clove tea are not mentioned in the given passages.", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 21.316, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 108, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 2924, 64364, 279, 37107, 323, 58544, 4405, 8464, 304, 279, 2487, 11, 8241, 15957, 504, 8464, 979, 9519, 448, 67086, 11, 28337, 11, 323, 3701, 309, 316, 304, 3015, 323, 4429, 448, 25744, 13, 18679, 586, 15243, 1083, 702, 3181, 4188, 325, 28500, 429, 975, 1632, 369, 1846, 15