{"id": "46", "pred": "Step 1: Lay your quilt on a bed, table or or flat surface. Step 2: Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. Step 3: Fold the lower left corner on toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. Step 4: Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. Step 5: Making sure the fold is on the bias, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt.", "raw_output": "Step 1: Lay your quilt on a bed, table or or flat surface. Step 2: Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. Step 3: Fold the lower left corner on toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. Step 4: Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. Step 5: Making sure the fold is on the bias, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt.", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 25.848, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 118, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 43924, 697, 60736, 389, 264, 4845, 11, 1965, 476, 476, 10063, 7329, 13, 14822, 220, 17, 25, 60473, 279, 4722, 1290, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 3259, 2704, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 14822, 220, 18, 25, 60473, 279, 4722, 2115, 9131, 389, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 3259, 2704, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 14822, 220, 19, 25, 60473, 279, 1909, 2115, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 3259, 2704, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 14822, 220, 20, 25, 24288, 2704, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 11, 11555, 279, 1909, 1290, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 1