{"id": "50", "pred": "Benefits of a Water Pik include helping to maintain good oral health by massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis, and cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas area that brushing can not access.", "raw_output": "Benefits of a Water Pik include helping to maintain good oral health by massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis, and cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas area that brushing can not access.", "gt": "A water pick, also known as a Waterpik, is a beneficial tool for oral care. It is designed to shoot a strong stream of water at the gum line to help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush. It can also help maintain overall body health. In comparison to flossing, using a water pick can be easier and leave your mouth feeling cleaner. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. It is especially useful in cleaning around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot reach.", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 10.471, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 51, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [84323, 315, 264, 9959, 61162, 2924, 10476, 311, 10306, 1661, 20655, 2820, 553, 3072, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 17719, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 11, 323, 15826, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 3082, 429, 76726, 646, 537, 2615, 13], "logp_list": [-0.957, -0.0222, -0.0504, -0.6937, -0.0923, -0.1737, -1.2009, -0.0543, -0.1234, -0.0105, -0.0006, -0.0071, -0.9985, -0.0459, -0.0001, -0.0013, -0.0021, -0.0145, -0.0077, -0.0879, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.1508, -0.3905, -0.0005, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0