{"id": "522", "pred": "Tallahassee, Florida has an overall average high temperature of just 79 degrees and an average low of only 56 degrees.", "raw_output": "Tallahassee, Florida has an overall average high temperature of just 79 degrees and an average low of only 56 degrees.", "gt": "Tallahassee, Florida has an overall average high temperature of 79 degrees and an average low of 56 degrees. Freezing temperatures can sporadically occur from November to March, with two or three nights on average even dropping to 20 °F or lower.", "question": "temperature for tallahassee florida", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 5.899, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 29, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [51, 76478, 300, 4060, 11, 9589, 702, 458, 8084, 5461, 1550, 9315, 315, 1101, 220, 22, 24, 12348, 323, 458, 5461, 3347, 315, 1172, 220, 20, 21, 12348, 13], "logp_list": [-2.5969, -0.0621, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.8151, -0.0387, -0.2289, -0.0123, -0.0493, -0.0004, -0.0007, -0.0039, -0.0008, -0.0133, -0.0003, -0.0019, -0.0003, -0.0023, -0.0464, -0.002, -0.0007, -0.0003, -0.0021, -0.0068, -0.0004, -0.0008, -0.0002, -0.0013, -0.8354], "cumulative_logprob": -4.7245, "norm_logp": -0.1629, "input_len": 351, "output_tokens": 29, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 59.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.9, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "532", "pred": "safety pins are be used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. Safety pins can be used to secure a bandana that a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. They can even be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. And", "raw_output": "safety pins are be used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. Safety pins can be used to secure a bandana that a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. They can even be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. And", "gt": "Safety pins in a first aid box are used for various purposes such as immobilizing an arm by creating a makeshift sling, securing a bandana over a wounded arm or leg, closing severe wounds in emergency situations, and removing splinters.", "question": "what are safety pins in a first aid box used for", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 14.206, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 71, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [82, 38618, 26944, 525, 387, 1483, 311, 76341, 551, 458, 6773, 553, 8983, 1229, 279, 74423, 315, 264, 1293, 36153, 15478, 311, 1181, 15138, 311, 11153, 264, 86080, 6773, 87633, 13, 18702, 26944, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 9767, 264, 7055, 3362, 429, 264, 27493, 323, 34663, 6773, 476, 2472, 13, 2379, 646, 1496, 387, 1483, 311, 1492, 2506, 264, 15386, 26555, 7877, 304, 1992, 315, 61936, 304, 13207, 13161, 13, 1597], "logp_list": [-1.7255, -0.0015, -0.057, -0.6138, -0.1697, -0.0103, -0.0958, -0.88, -0.0041, -0.0072, -0.0011, -0.2502, -0.0016, -0.0002, -0.0018, -0.0008, -0.0022, -0.0007, -0.0025, -0.0039, -0.002, -0.0107, -0.005, -0.0007, -0.0123, -0.0064, -0.0025, -0.0001, -0.0017, -0.0008, -0.1958, -0.3872, -0.004, -0.0011, -0.0067, -0.0007, -0.0004,