{"id": "672", "pred": "The weighted average method of inventory costing assigns an average cost to each piece of inventory when it is", "raw_output": "The weighted average method of inventory costing assigns an average cost to each piece of inventory when it is", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it can be understood that the Weighted Average Costing (WAC) method is used to determine the average cost of inventory when a unit is sold. This method takes the average cost of all inventories currently available and uses it to calculate the weighted average cost per unit. WAC is commonly used when inventory items are intermingled and it's difficult to assign a specific cost to an individual unit, or when the accounting system is not sophisticated enough to track FIFO or LIFO inventory layers.", "question": "inventory costing weighted average", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 4.186, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 19, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 36824, 5461, 1714, 315, 15444, 53724, 49912, 458, 5461, 2783, 311, 1817, 6573, 315, 15444, 979, 432, 374], "logp_list": [-0.6447, -0.2266, -0.0088, -0.0671, -0.3579, -0.4354, -0.0046, -0.155, -0.0755, -0.0001, -0.0032, -0.0124, -0.0027, -0.0613, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0264, -0.0019, -0.0003], "cumulative_logprob": -2.0839, "norm_logp": -0.1097, "input_len": 482, "output_tokens": 19, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "679", "pred": "The benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses and relieving stress in the body, providing relief from stress when mixed with basil, mint, and cardamom in water and taken with honey. Clove tea also has analgesse qualities that work well for those suffering from gas pain or stomach upset, stimulating blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion. Additionally, clove tea compresses are an excellent way to relieve pain from any muscle, joint or ligament injury when applied to unbroken skin", "raw_output": "The benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses and relieving stress in the body, providing relief from stress when mixed with basil, mint, and cardamom in water and taken with honey. Clove tea also has analgesse qualities that work well for those suffering from gas pain or stomach upset, stimulating blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion. Additionally, clove tea compresses are an excellent way to relieve pain from any muscle, joint or ligament injury when applied to unbroken skin", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea:\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Soothes the senses and relieves stress (Passage 1)\n* Provides relief from pain due to muscle, joint, or ligament injuries (Passage 2)\n* Soothes abdominal pain and aids in digestion (Passage 3)\n\nSide Effects:\n\n* None mentioned in the passages.\n\nNote that there are no side effects mentioned in the passages provided. However, it's important to note that consuming clove tea in large quantities can cause irritation to the stomach and digestive tract, so it's best to consume it in moderation.", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 21.551, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_t