{"id": "689", "pred": "$12,000", "raw_output": "$12,000", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.\n\nThe passages provided do not contain specific information about the cost of replacing sewer lines in Michigan or any other location. Passage 2 mentions general cost ranges for sewer line repair and replacement, but these costs are not specific to Michigan and may vary depending on various factors such as location, materials, and labor costs. Passage 3 is a call to action to ask a question on Angie's List, but does not provide any information relevant to the question at hand. Therefore, I cannot provide an answer to the question based on the given passages.", "question": "michigan-how much to replace sewer lines", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 3.171, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 7, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [3, 16, 17, 11, 15, 15, 15], "logp_list": [-0.5712, -0.6589, -0.4642, -0.0135, -0.0015, -0.0001, -0.0056], "cumulative_logprob": -1.715, "norm_logp": -0.245, "input_len": 367, "output_tokens": 7, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "695", "pred": "Pour cold ice cream mix into an ice cream maker, turn on the machine, and churn according to manufacturer's directions, 20 to 25 minutes. When ice cream is softly frozen, serve immediately or place a piece of plastic wrap directly on the ice cream and place in freezer to ripen,", "raw_output": "Pour cold ice cream mix into an ice cream maker, turn on the machine, and churn according to manufacturer's directions, 20 to 25 minutes. When ice cream is softly frozen, serve immediately or place a piece of plastic wrap directly on the ice cream and place in freezer to ripen,", "gt": "To make ice cream, you start by stirring sugar, cream, and milk into a saucepan over low heat until the sugar has dissolved. Heat just until the mix is hot and a small ring of foam appears around the edge. Next, transfer the cream mixture to a pourable container such as a large measuring cup and stir in vanilla extract. Chill the mix thoroughly, for at least 2 hours. Once chilled, pour the cold ice cream mix into an ice cream maker, turn on the machine, and churn according to manufacturer's directions for 20 to 25 minutes. When the ice cream is softly frozen, you can serve it immediately or place a piece of plastic wrap directly on the ice cream and place it in the freezer to ripen for 2 to 3 hours.", "question": "How do you make ice cream", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "opera", "has_visual": false, "n_image_tokens": 0, "time_sec": 12.531, "status": "success", "n_rollback": 0, "n_tokens": 63, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [42178, 9255, 9853, 12644, 6514, 1119, 458, 9853, 12644, 24232, 11, 2484, 389, 279, 5662, 11, 323, 80869, 4092, 311, 13963, 594, 17961, 11, 220, 17, 15, 311, 220, 17, 20, 4420, 13, 3197, 9853, 12644, 374, 56050, 19690, 11, 8683, 7069, 476, 1992, 264, 6573, 315, 12188, 15061, 5961, 389, 279, 9853, 12644, 323, 1992, 304, 49585, 311, 23288, 268, 11, 220], "logp_list": [-1.0913, -0.1665, -0.001